{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Easy to Learn, Difficult to Master</h2>SurvivalScape is a thrilling survival-based auto shooter where your goal is to defeat enemies, collect crystals, and level up to become the ultimate hero. Climb the leaderboards and challenge your friends for the top score.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Unique Bosses<br></li><li>Multiple Classes<br></li><li>Unlockable Maps<br></li><li>Boss Rush Mode<br></li><li>Weekly Challenge<br></li><li>Controller Support<br></li><li>Ultra-wide Support<br></li><li>Twitch Integration - Have Twitch chat choose your upgrades!</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Boss Rush</h2>After clearing a level, you'll unlock Boss Rush mode for that map. Instantly level up to the max and defeat the boss as quickly as possible to achieve the highest score!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862660/extras/a33aece5147fefede2f69a90d60391c7.poster.avif?t=1769548033\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862660/extras/a33aece5147fefede2f69a90d60391c7.webm?t=1769548033\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862660/extras/a33aece5147fefede2f69a90d60391c7.mp4?t=1769548033\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Obelisks of Power</h2>Capture and hold an Obelisk of Power for <strong>ten seconds</strong> to immediately level up your hero.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862660/extras/67531e3b9db7eea62d16070d05f29980.poster.avif?t=1769548033\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862660/extras/67531e3b9db7eea62d16070d05f29980.webm?t=1769548033\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862660/extras/67531e3b9db7eea62d16070d05f29980.mp4?t=1769548033\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >No Meta Progression</h2>Every run you go from <i>zero to hero</i>, ensuring every player begins with the same advantage. Gain power as you progress, <strong>keeping the playing field level for fair scoring</strong>.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Weekly Challenge</h2>The weekly challenge randomly selects a map and class, eliminating all random elements. No health potions, no obelisks, no rerolls\u2014just a pure test of skill.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Flawless Run","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2862660/60d942666976db90d7b9b3f1ee0ca84994ad4b3b.jpg"},{"name":"Full Health","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2862660/a555bd06db510d651e1c25b102afad8441989ef4.jpg"},{"name":"Complete the Weekly Challenge","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2862660/66b08dd6324154bfa254589a6343e39c31d77962.jpg"},{"name":"Start Your Adventure","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2862660/16ebd95f9f295f0c5aedf714707f6b6528106dd6.jpg"},{"name":"Capture an Obelisk","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2862660/7db47dac6f1f4a996969f1ed560605f1a58195dd.jpg"},{"name":"Try the Weekly Challenge","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2862660/417120b49cf67e5cf52f5476fb34932feece2ff6.jpg"},{"name":"Clear Dungeon","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2862660/34b9f539adf3394f6172a7d441578c8473952054.jpg"},{"name":"Clear Sewer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2862660/ee800417c7141616c55746d75acbb528e7c55a2e.jpg"},{"name":"Cl